  "internal_only_reason": "Scope and dismissal are Nomi domain invariants; pi does not own payment or canvas content.",
  "invariants": [
    "Requested shot IDs are validated atomically and presented in plan order.",
    "The representative candidate follows the presented shot scope, so an excluded model cannot govern another shot's confirmation.",
    "Dismissing an unapproved request retains all creative content and invalidates waiting authority.",
    "Submitted jobs are never erased or automatically retried by dismissal.",
    "Successive batches preserve job history and accumulate liability within the configured Run hard cap.",
    "Historical job observation uses the original frozen execution contract and cannot restore old spend authority.",
    "A human spend confirmation retains its captured committed project binding through lease and gate awaits until authorization begins; already authorized background execution is unaffected."
  ],
